    <description><![CDATA[ 食用油 200g 冷油下葱姜八角花椒桂皮香叶，小火慢熬 10 分钟，葱浅金黄立刻关火，浸凉后滤渣。 ]]></description>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
  </item><item>
    <title>葱油面</title>
    <link>https://longbatian.site/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/%E7%B4%A0%E9%A3%9F%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80/%E8%91%B1%E6%B2%B9%E9%9D%A2</link>
